  "content": "<p>歡迎！此模組為 ProjectE 增添了一些酷炫且極強的物品與方塊！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>目前，它添加了（列表非常過時！）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>EMC 導管\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/conduit_mk1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">MK1 -&nbsp; 每秒 256 EMC</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/conduit_mk2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">MK2 -&nbsp; 每秒 1,024 EMC</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/conduit_mk3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">MK3 -&nbsp; 每秒 4,096 EMC</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/conduit_mk4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">MK4 -&nbsp; 每秒 16,384 EMC</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/zeitheron_fuel_block.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;Zeitheron 燃料方塊</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/blue_matter_block.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;藍物質方塊</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/collector_mk4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;能量收集器 MK4</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/relay_mk4.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;反物質中繼器 MK4</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/blue_matter.gif\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;藍物質</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/zeitheron_fuel.gif\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;Zeitheron 燃料</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/emc_proxy.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;EMC 代理 - 吸收來自收集器、中繼器和導管的所有輸入 EMC。當擁有者在線時，將 EMC 轉移至擁有者的煉金轉換手冊。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">截至目前，歡迎提出想法！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>許可權：</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>您可以在您的模組包中使用此模組。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>未經允許，不得在未提供 Modrinth/CurseForge 下載鏈接及我的許可的情況下，將此模組重新發布到其他網站（請私信 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fme.zeith.gay%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/icons/zeitheron.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;Zeitheron</a>，或通過 Discord）</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>不允許將此模組（或 DragonForge 團隊的任何其他模組）包含在您自己的模組中。然而，構建附加模組是被允許的，但最好事先友好地私信告知。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>唯一支持的 Minecraft 版本是此模組存在的最新版本。請勿要求降級！</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fds.zeith.org%252fdev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ds.zeith.org/cards/dev.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"170\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想討論任何事情？需要 API 幫助嗎？</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>加入 Discord 服務器並關注 Zeitheron 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252fZeithTwitter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/favicons/twitter.ico\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">Twitter</a>！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>如果您想支持我的工作，您可以通過 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/zeitheron\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/favicon/favicon-32x32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;Patreon</a> 成為贊助者。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/pix.iemoji.com/twit33/0744.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"33\"></strong></p>",
